# The Holodeck's one permission covers both zones: once Llanowar Elves is cast from the graveyard, Grizzly Bears in the
# sideboard can't be cast the same turn, though the mana to pay for it is there; a sideboard instant is no permanent card
# (CR 110.4a); on the opponent's turn the flash Ambush Viper can't be cast from outside the game ("each of your turns");
# on its controller's next turn the permission is back and Grizzly Bears is cast (CR 400.11b, 601.3, 604.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Black Lotus x3
The Holodeck
Forest x15

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Grizzly Bears
Fog
Ambush Viper

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

